# Build context for the PORTAL image is Docker/ (see docker-compose.yml:
# `context: .` + `dockerfile: portal/Dockerfile`), because the Lab Config
# renderer needs the redirector vhost template and the Havoc profile template
# from their sibling directories.
#
# This keeps that wider context cheap: without it, the whole Docker/ tree -
# including the vendored Havoc/Adaptix/Sliver/Meridian source trees, state
# volumes and .env - would be shipped to the daemon on every portal rebuild.
*
# The portal needs only its own sources plus the two config templates.
!portal/
# The parent directories MUST be re-included as well: Docker walks the tree
# top-down and will not descend into a directory that is still excluded, so
# un-ignoring the file alone silently leaves it out of the context.
!redirector/
!redirector/apache/
!redirector/apache/c2stack.conf.template
!havoc/
!havoc/havoc.yaotl
